      "id": "ACC_GROTHENDIECK_CONNECTEDNESS",
      "kind": "precisely_cited_published_theorem",
      "statement": "Stacks Lemma 52.14.1 (0ECR), for a complete Noetherian local ring and proper ideal. At irreducible spectrum of dimension r and h generators, removing a closed subset of dimension less than r-1-h leaves a connected space. The cohomological-dimension bound follows from the h-generator Cech complex. ACC2 gives the complete graph/dimension application; regularity is not added.",
